  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "God's Final Word: His Son",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the past God spoke to our ancestors through the prophets at many times and in various ways,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but in these last days he has spoken to us by his Son, whom he appointed heir of all things, and through whom also he made the universe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Son is the radiance of God's glory and the exact representation of his being, sustaining all things by his powerful word. After he had provided purification for sins, he sat down at the right hand of the Majesty in heaven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he became as much superior to the angels as the name he has inherited is superior to theirs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Son Superior to Angels",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For to which of the angels did God ever say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 1:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"You are my Son;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "today I have become your Father\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "HEB 1:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Or again,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 1:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I will be his Father,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he will be my Son\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And again, when God brings his firstborn into the world, he says,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 1:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Let all God's angels worship him.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In speaking of the angels he says,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 1:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"He makes his angels spirits,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and his servants flames of fire.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But about the Son he says,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 1:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Your throne, O God, will last for ever and ever;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "a scepter of justice will be the scepter of your kingdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have loved righteousness and hated wickedness;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "therefore God, your God, has set you above your companions",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "by anointing you with the oil of joy.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also says,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 1:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"In the beginning, Lord, you laid the foundations of the earth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the heavens are the work of your hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will perish, but you remain;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they will all wear out like a garment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will roll them up like a robe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "like a garment they will be changed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 1:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But you remain the same,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and your years will never end.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To which of the angels did God ever say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 1:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Sit at my right hand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "until I make your enemies",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 1:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "a footstool for your feet\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Are not all angels ministering spirits sent to serve those who will inherit salvation?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
